WEBVTT

01:37.530 --> 01:42.910
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.390 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 15]

01:47.370 --> 01:54.220
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

01:54.289 --> 02:01.530
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

01:55.120 --> 01:56.520
What are you trying to do?

01:56.680 --> 01:59.000
I'd never take advantage of
someone in distress.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.920
Or is it because you think
this scar is unsightly

02:00.920 --> 02:02.070
and don't want anyone to see it?

02:01.550 --> 02:04.910
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

02:04.940 --> 02:08.639
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

02:08.660 --> 02:15.510
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

02:15.580 --> 02:22.700
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

02:22.829 --> 02:30.000
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

02:27.360 --> 02:28.310
If it hurts,

02:29.000 --> 02:30.310
you can hold on tighter.

02:30.030 --> 02:33.810
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

02:31.150 --> 02:32.280
I wouldn't mind.

02:33.900 --> 02:37.260
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

02:37.390 --> 02:44.740
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

02:44.760 --> 02:51.210
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

02:51.260 --> 02:58.610
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

02:58.640 --> 03:02.480
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

03:02.500 --> 03:05.860
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

03:05.890 --> 03:12.900
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

03:12.920 --> 03:20.400
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

03:20.430 --> 03:27.750
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

03:27.780 --> 03:31.880
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

03:31.900 --> 03:35.140
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

03:32.400 --> 03:33.000
Chunzhi.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.520
Victory news came
from the west of the city,

03:34.520 --> 03:35.680
saying that half of the northern bandits
have retreated.

03:35.160 --> 03:40.820
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

03:36.000 --> 03:37.150
To win this battle,

03:37.280 --> 03:39.680
we still have to rely
on your father's help.

03:52.590 --> 03:54.310
Fourth Lady has a strong temper,

03:54.310 --> 03:56.520
and is definitely not someone
who changes her mind easily.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.630
If you understand,

03:58.520 --> 03:59.650
you should let it go.

04:01.800 --> 04:02.840
Letting go

04:03.240 --> 04:04.150
is easy to say.

04:05.590 --> 04:06.520
But in this world,

04:06.520 --> 04:07.920
not many people can do it.

04:10.080 --> 04:11.610
The bitterness of feelings

04:12.150 --> 04:13.120
is in that

04:14.430 --> 04:16.230
while knowing it's impossible,

04:16.310 --> 04:17.640
one still insists on it.

04:20.160 --> 04:20.950
Forget it.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.750
Since I have seen Fourth Lady,

04:23.750 --> 04:24.390
I shall

04:24.510 --> 04:25.910
go back to fulfill my duty

04:26.750 --> 04:29.150
and wipe out the remnants
of these bandits.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.040
Let's go!

04:30.480 --> 04:31.680
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

04:33.720 --> 04:34.480
Lanshan!

04:36.270 --> 04:37.400
Where are you going?

04:37.510 --> 04:38.440
To kill enemies!

04:41.830 --> 04:42.720
Brat.

05:08.310 --> 05:15.070
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

05:15.140 --> 05:21.620
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

05:21.720 --> 05:29.360
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

05:29.480 --> 05:36.780
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

05:31.000 --> 05:32.150
When I was little,

05:33.390 --> 05:35.310
someone once told me:

05:36.560 --> 05:38.560
no matter what happens,

05:36.920 --> 05:43.850
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

05:40.150 --> 05:41.240
one has to survive.

05:42.190 --> 05:43.560
Only by surviving

05:43.920 --> 05:44.950
is there hope.

05:43.950 --> 05:53.950
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

05:45.870 --> 05:47.150
So since then,

05:48.680 --> 05:51.010
no matter what difficulties I encounter,

05:52.360 --> 05:54.159
as long as I think of these words,

05:54.290 --> 06:01.250
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

05:55.360 --> 05:57.290
there is nothing I can't overcome.

05:59.040 --> 05:59.830
Today,

06:01.290 --> 06:08.680
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

06:01.360 --> 06:03.160
I'm telling you these words too.

06:06.510 --> 06:07.840
You have to survive too,

06:08.710 --> 06:12.290
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

06:09.480 --> 06:10.270
okay?

06:12.310 --> 06:15.930
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

06:15.960 --> 06:22.070
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

07:08.920 --> 07:11.320
Thank you, Fourth Lady,
for saving my life.

07:15.510 --> 07:17.710
You are so good at making trouble for me.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.310
If I saw you less often,

07:19.480 --> 07:20.270
maybe

07:20.270 --> 07:22.480
I could live a few more years
of peaceful life.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.240
Is that so?

07:24.680 --> 07:27.040
But the how nervous you looked just now...

07:29.360 --> 07:31.890
seems like
you're concerned about my safety.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.150
Fourth Lady.

07:38.800 --> 07:39.950
Lord Yan is awake.

07:42.070 --> 07:42.800
Just in time.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.890
Hurry up and eat something.

07:46.560 --> 07:47.920
I'll go get busy first.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.470
Thank you, Madam Pei.

07:50.150 --> 07:51.880
Aren't you looking for Cui'er?

07:53.800 --> 07:55.000
If Madam Pei is here,

07:55.600 --> 07:57.200
how could Cui'er not be here?

07:57.560 --> 07:59.620
She is now Madam Pei's personal maid,

08:00.600 --> 08:02.800
and has changed her name to Guoniang.

08:04.120 --> 08:04.870
Careful.

08:12.360 --> 08:13.890
Madam, does your back hurt?

08:14.800 --> 08:15.600
It's fine.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.270
Everyone will get some.

08:17.270 --> 08:17.870
Thank you.

08:18.390 --> 08:18.870
Here.

08:23.870 --> 08:24.360
Here.

08:24.600 --> 08:27.200
Madam, you've been busy all night.
Let me do it.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.310
Okay, then you do it.

08:31.070 --> 08:32.030
Take a rest.

08:32.789 --> 08:33.360
Slowly.

08:36.200 --> 08:37.260
Careful, it's hot.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.550
Fourth Lady,

08:46.550 --> 08:47.750
what brings you here?

08:49.200 --> 08:49.910
Madam Pei,

08:50.240 --> 08:51.700
I'm looking for Guoniang.

08:52.030 --> 08:53.000
Guo?

08:54.030 --> 08:54.960
What is it about?

08:55.320 --> 08:56.910
I'd like to ask her some questions

08:56.910 --> 08:58.120
about my mother.

09:01.670 --> 09:02.440
Of course.

09:03.150 --> 09:03.840
Come, Guo.

09:04.200 --> 09:05.530
Go with the Fourth Lady.

09:06.030 --> 09:06.720
I'll do it.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.630
Go.

09:18.200 --> 09:20.200
I have followed Madam for many years

09:20.440 --> 09:22.840
and am not familiar
with the Xie Residence.

09:22.870 --> 09:24.910
I wonder why My Lady summoned me.

09:26.910 --> 09:29.770
Are you really not familiar
with the Xie Residence?

09:29.960 --> 09:31.220
What should I call you?

09:32.960 --> 09:33.910
Guoniang...

09:34.790 --> 09:35.790
or Cui'er?

09:41.030 --> 09:42.960
I can't escape this fate after all.

09:47.120 --> 09:48.520
I guessed you would come,

09:49.150 --> 09:51.080
but I didn't expect it to be so soon.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.820
So many years have passed.

09:53.320 --> 09:55.980
What's the point
of still pursuing this matter?

09:56.320 --> 09:57.980
It just adds to your troubles.

10:00.600 --> 10:02.660
This is about my mother's innocence,

10:02.790 --> 10:04.390
not some so-called trouble.

10:04.870 --> 10:06.530
My mother didn't kill anyone.

10:06.600 --> 10:09.060
Why should she bear
the infamy of a murderer?

10:12.790 --> 10:13.630
Guoniang,

10:14.670 --> 10:16.330
please testify for my mother.

10:16.910 --> 10:17.870
If possible,

10:18.750 --> 10:21.870
I wouldn't want Concubine Xia
and Concubine Jin to die in vain either.

10:21.870 --> 10:23.750
But overturning a case is not easy.

10:23.750 --> 10:25.910
They are just dead people from the past.

10:25.910 --> 10:27.910
Do you think anyone cares about the truth

10:27.910 --> 10:29.550
here at the Xie family?

10:31.480 --> 10:32.390
Fourth Lady.

10:33.200 --> 10:36.000
I'm just afraid that
before you find out the truth,

10:36.030 --> 10:37.760
you'll end up like your mother.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.030
After all these years,

10:42.510 --> 10:43.630
you've been hiding

10:43.630 --> 10:44.890
and changed your name.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.990
You're just afraid of death.

10:50.270 --> 10:51.720
I've already died once.

10:52.510 --> 10:53.960
The old Cui'er

10:54.550 --> 10:56.280
died long ago with Fourth Madam

10:56.600 --> 10:58.200
and those who knew the truth,

10:58.480 --> 10:59.480
together.

11:05.440 --> 11:08.240
The past of the Xie family
has nothing to do with me.

11:08.670 --> 11:10.480
Please don't come

11:10.480 --> 11:12.810
and disturb my life anymore, Fourth Lady.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.480
If it's true as you said

11:14.790 --> 11:16.920
that you no longer care about the past,

11:17.120 --> 11:18.920
then why did you change your name

11:19.080 --> 11:20.080
to Guo?

11:27.600 --> 11:28.240
Madam.

11:29.150 --> 11:30.750
The rice's almost finished.

11:31.030 --> 11:31.960
The city is still under martial law

11:31.960 --> 11:33.320
and no one can go in or out.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.550
Where can we get rice?

11:35.030 --> 11:36.200
Don't worry.

11:36.360 --> 11:38.360
Lord Yan prepared a pass for us.

11:38.480 --> 11:40.010
I'll go buy some rice later.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.810
Help me chop those vegetables.

11:43.870 --> 11:44.440
Yes.

11:44.750 --> 11:45.390
Here.

11:48.790 --> 11:51.270
Thanks to Zhenglun
for bringing reinforcements,

11:51.270 --> 11:53.480
our Xie Residence is safe.

11:54.480 --> 11:55.320
Son,

11:55.720 --> 11:56.650
are you alright?

11:57.240 --> 11:58.240
I'm fine, Mother.

12:00.030 --> 12:01.200
But Fourth Sister...

12:01.200 --> 12:03.000
The city was in chaos last night.

12:03.120 --> 12:05.480
A young lady out alone like her—

12:05.910 --> 12:08.040
it's hard to tell if she's still alive.

12:08.790 --> 12:10.190
We haven't found her yet,

12:10.600 --> 12:13.060
but it doesn't mean
she met with an accident.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.030
Maybe

12:14.870 --> 12:16.200
she is with Lord Yan.

12:16.790 --> 12:17.440
Or maybe

12:17.670 --> 12:20.670
she went to the disaster relief site
outside the city.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.670
Zhenglun is right.

12:29.120 --> 12:31.240
The city was in chaos last night.

12:31.510 --> 12:33.960
It's already a blessing
that our Xie Residence

12:33.960 --> 12:35.080
is safe.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.270
Mother,

12:36.270 --> 12:37.670
don't worry too much.

12:37.960 --> 12:40.150
Qingyuan is a mascot.

12:40.320 --> 12:42.000
She is blessed

12:42.150 --> 12:43.480
and will return safely.

12:44.000 --> 12:45.030
What mascot?

12:45.550 --> 12:47.480
She clearly came to cause trouble.

12:48.510 --> 12:49.510
Enough!

12:51.840 --> 12:52.750
Qingyuan

12:53.600 --> 12:56.000
is a lady of our Xie family after all.

12:57.480 --> 13:00.340
How can you talk about
her life and death so lightly?

13:02.750 --> 13:03.840
Send people to search

13:03.840 --> 13:05.500
for Fourth Lady immediately.

13:05.750 --> 13:06.960
Don't forget

13:07.630 --> 13:09.670
why she went out.

13:11.030 --> 13:11.720
-Yes.
-Yes.

13:13.390 --> 13:14.150
Zhenglun,

13:14.840 --> 13:18.150
is there any news about Wei Changyan?

13:19.610 --> 13:20.480
He has escaped.

13:21.060 --> 13:23.190
The authorities are hunting him down.

13:26.200 --> 13:27.080
Guoniang.

13:27.750 --> 13:29.480
I know you are different from those

13:29.480 --> 13:30.680
who harmed my mother.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.560
If you tell the truth,

13:33.510 --> 13:34.360
it might be

13:34.750 --> 13:36.030
a relief for you.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.970
I've done many wrong things in my life.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.200
I wanted a home

13:44.870 --> 13:46.200
and gave myself to a man,

13:46.270 --> 13:48.750
only to be sold
and reduced to a medicine slave.

13:48.750 --> 13:50.480
I wanted to turn my life around,

13:50.600 --> 13:52.530
so I hid in the noble Xie Residence.

13:52.910 --> 13:56.310
Yet I was reduced to an accomplice
in the concubines' fights.

13:56.630 --> 13:57.790
For half my life,

13:58.360 --> 14:00.030
I have been hiding and wandering,

14:00.030 --> 14:01.440
living like a ghost.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.030
Only Madam Pei

14:06.960 --> 14:08.000
truly...

14:08.630 --> 14:09.750
truly accepted me.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.300
Little beggar.

14:11.630 --> 14:12.390
Come here.

14:12.960 --> 14:14.720
Help me distribute
the rest of the porridge.

14:14.720 --> 14:17.480
I'm going to go get the travel pass
to buy some grain.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.120
Yes.

14:18.750 --> 14:20.240
She was very good to me.

14:21.000 --> 14:23.320
-In this world...
-Don't worry, everyone. There's enough.

14:23.320 --> 14:25.780
There is no longer a place
for people like us.

14:27.320 --> 14:28.440
My only salvation

14:29.600 --> 14:30.510
was Madam Pei.

14:39.670 --> 14:40.480
Who are you?

14:41.040 --> 14:42.120
[Travel Pass]

14:44.150 --> 14:45.180
What are you doing?

14:45.180 --> 14:46.440
[Travel Pass]

14:58.480 --> 15:00.550
But given Madam Pei's nature,

15:02.720 --> 15:04.270
she would certainly want

15:04.510 --> 15:06.110
you to testify for my mother.

15:08.080 --> 15:09.030
Fourth Lady.

15:10.480 --> 15:11.750
I changed my name to Guo

15:12.440 --> 15:13.550
not just to remind myself

15:13.550 --> 15:15.410
of the mistakes I made in the past,

15:15.600 --> 15:16.870
but also to warn myself

15:17.870 --> 15:19.270
that the past is the past,

15:19.790 --> 15:21.250
and I shouldn't look back.

15:24.030 --> 15:25.000
Murder!

15:26.030 --> 15:27.000
Somebody help!

15:27.360 --> 15:29.220
Something happened to Madam Pei!

15:29.840 --> 15:31.030
Help!

15:46.960 --> 15:47.550
Madam!

15:48.120 --> 15:48.630
Madam!

15:49.320 --> 15:50.790
-What's wrong, madam?
-Excuse me.

15:50.790 --> 15:51.720
Guo...

15:52.600 --> 15:53.320
Madam!

15:53.910 --> 15:54.720
Madam!

15:55.030 --> 15:55.840
Guo...

15:57.360 --> 15:58.080
Guo...

15:58.320 --> 15:59.120
Who?

15:59.510 --> 16:00.320
Who was it?

16:01.440 --> 16:03.240
In the future, you must live well

16:03.960 --> 16:05.670
by yourself.

16:06.120 --> 16:06.840
Madam.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.870
Madam.

16:10.320 --> 16:12.440
You are no one's servant.

16:14.960 --> 16:16.630
You are yourself.

16:17.600 --> 16:18.200
Madam.

16:18.440 --> 16:20.040
Please stop talking, Madam.

16:22.270 --> 16:23.270
Help...

16:23.630 --> 16:24.960
Help!

16:26.510 --> 16:27.750
Help!

16:29.000 --> 16:29.840
Help me...

16:30.440 --> 16:31.480
Help me...

16:32.440 --> 16:34.200
take good care of them...

16:37.630 --> 16:38.240
Madam.

16:42.720 --> 16:43.440
Madam.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.030
Madam.

16:46.480 --> 16:48.750
Madam!

16:50.550 --> 16:52.240
Someone please save her!

16:52.960 --> 16:54.600
Someone please save Madam!

16:54.910 --> 16:55.720
Guoniang!

16:55.720 --> 16:56.630
I saw a man

16:56.840 --> 16:58.770
running towards the thick forest.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.200
Guoniang!

17:06.349 --> 17:07.349
Come out!

17:10.109 --> 17:11.400
Come out here!

17:15.349 --> 17:16.550
Come out!

17:21.000 --> 17:22.069
Come out!

17:22.240 --> 17:23.220
Come out!

17:24.750 --> 17:25.550
Who is it?

17:26.030 --> 17:27.319
Come out here!

17:27.880 --> 17:29.030
Come out here!

17:29.790 --> 17:30.720
Guo!

17:32.720 --> 17:33.510
Guo!

17:47.880 --> 17:48.480
Let her go.

17:49.350 --> 17:51.240
The whole city is hunting
for Northern bandits.

17:51.240 --> 17:53.700
Do you think
that travel pass will be useful?

17:59.350 --> 18:00.070
Qingyuan.

18:01.720 --> 18:02.480
Qingyuan!

18:04.510 --> 18:05.200
Qingyuan!

18:07.000 --> 18:07.660
Don't move.

18:07.750 --> 18:09.010
Take me instead of her.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.550
Qingyuan!

18:11.680 --> 18:13.920
You should know very well
who's more important

18:13.920 --> 18:15.300
to Yan Rui—me or her?

18:15.830 --> 18:16.590
Don't,

18:16.590 --> 18:17.350
Fourth Lady.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.820
Since you have nowhere to run,

18:26.640 --> 18:28.310
why not trade me for a way out?

18:30.590 --> 18:31.550
She is right.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.310
Yan Rui—

18:33.720 --> 18:34.780
Don't come closer.

18:38.960 --> 18:39.830
Wei Changyan.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.350
If you hurt her,

18:41.790 --> 18:42.790
not only me,

18:43.270 --> 18:45.670
but the Xie family
won't let you off either.

18:45.750 --> 18:47.030
The Xie family?

18:47.720 --> 18:49.920
Trading her life for my silence,

18:50.400 --> 18:53.000
I'm afraid Xie Shu
would wish for nothing more.

18:56.240 --> 18:57.240
After all,

18:57.790 --> 19:00.510
he and I serve the same Lord.

19:05.440 --> 19:06.880
Do you think I don't know?

19:07.480 --> 19:10.160
You've been plotting against me all along,

19:10.400 --> 19:11.640
just to find out

19:11.640 --> 19:13.400
who is behind me.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.240
Right?

19:16.960 --> 19:17.550
Fine.

19:17.680 --> 19:18.960
I shall tell you then.

20:11.270 --> 20:13.130
Fourth Sister fell into the water

20:13.240 --> 20:14.700
and hasn't been found yet.

20:15.550 --> 20:17.610
I'm afraid it's more likely bad news.

20:19.680 --> 20:21.810
Although the bandits are suppressed,

20:21.880 --> 20:23.240
Qingyuan is gone.

20:25.310 --> 20:27.680
I feel terrible.

20:29.920 --> 20:32.160
If I hadn't argued with her...

20:35.440 --> 20:37.070
But with her dead,

20:37.480 --> 20:39.540
whether she belongs to the Xie family

20:40.480 --> 20:41.830
is no longer important.

20:44.160 --> 20:44.680
Mother.

20:45.240 --> 20:46.790
We still haven't found her yet.

20:46.790 --> 20:47.270
Perhaps

20:48.040 --> 20:49.840
there is still a glimmer of hope.

20:51.030 --> 20:51.830
Hope?

20:52.720 --> 20:53.110
Uh...

20:53.270 --> 20:54.860
the water flows so fast.

20:55.110 --> 20:56.640
How could there be any hope?

20:57.590 --> 20:59.000
Qingyuan

20:59.440 --> 21:01.900
wandered about destitute in her childhood.

21:02.750 --> 21:04.410
She returned to the residence

21:05.240 --> 21:06.590
and just had a few

21:07.440 --> 21:08.920
peaceful days,

21:10.350 --> 21:12.610
but then she encountered this disaster.

21:13.440 --> 21:14.750
Her funeral affairs

21:15.480 --> 21:18.880
should be handled properly.

21:42.030 --> 21:43.430
Prepare for the funeral.

21:43.830 --> 21:45.490
It will be held in half a month.

21:45.880 --> 21:46.640
Yes.

21:51.030 --> 21:52.830
Thanks to that Qingyuan's death

21:52.830 --> 21:53.890
making Master sad,

21:54.200 --> 21:55.600
I now have another chance

21:55.720 --> 21:57.350
to win his favor back.

21:58.790 --> 21:59.750
I can tell...

22:02.400 --> 22:05.260
you are not really sad
about Fourth Sister's death.

22:05.960 --> 22:06.750
Brother.

22:07.000 --> 22:08.200
You child.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.400
How foolish.

22:09.790 --> 22:12.310
She targeted us time and again.

22:13.830 --> 22:15.720
Why should I be sad for her?

22:20.440 --> 22:21.000
Mother.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.680
Stop it.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.240
Can you?

22:28.510 --> 22:29.350
I beg you.

22:31.440 --> 22:33.000
I beg you, stop it.

22:37.790 --> 22:38.750
What did you say?

22:40.270 --> 22:41.590
What did you just say?

22:46.310 --> 22:47.350
All these years,

22:48.160 --> 22:49.350
all these pain...

22:50.510 --> 22:52.270
Do you think it's for myself?

22:53.310 --> 22:55.160
It's all for you two.

22:56.070 --> 22:58.270
I can accept that Zhengjun is ignorant.

22:59.070 --> 23:00.730
But you're the older brother.

23:01.920 --> 23:04.920
The treatment you received
in the Northern Frontier—

23:05.070 --> 23:06.200
if it weren't for me,

23:06.920 --> 23:08.510
would you have gotten it?

23:15.550 --> 23:16.310
Mother.

23:17.110 --> 23:18.970
I just want to say one thing to you.

23:21.350 --> 23:24.080
Father has been good enough
to us all these years.

23:24.400 --> 23:26.550
There's no need to fight for more.

23:37.240 --> 23:38.510
You child,

23:40.750 --> 23:43.270
studying must have ruined your brain.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.590
Treading on shoulders to reach the peak;

23:45.590 --> 23:47.440
cradling human faces
only to grind them into dust.

23:47.440 --> 23:49.790
You know to worry about
other people's mothers

23:49.790 --> 23:51.070
becoming victims,

23:53.480 --> 23:54.960
but when have you ever worried

23:54.960 --> 23:57.760
about the sacrifices
your own mother made for you?

24:10.830 --> 24:11.290
Mother.

24:11.440 --> 24:11.900
Mother!

24:12.590 --> 24:15.240
But none of this is an excuse
for you to hurt others.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.570
Stop talking, Brother.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.310
The reason you can stand here today

24:25.310 --> 24:27.030
to criticize me

24:28.510 --> 24:30.440
is because the price of the path

24:32.200 --> 24:33.750
you took

24:35.790 --> 24:37.350
was paid by your mother.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.160
You are all so high and mighty,

24:42.160 --> 24:43.620
keeping your hands clean—

24:44.550 --> 24:45.440
that's fine.

24:48.750 --> 24:50.270
But when your mother stood in front of you

24:50.270 --> 24:52.530
and shielded you from all the bad things,

24:53.200 --> 24:54.590
where were you?

24:55.030 --> 24:57.690
Without me,
who would protect you two brothers?

25:07.750 --> 25:08.280
Brother!

25:08.510 --> 25:09.070
Brother!

25:10.750 --> 25:11.400
Mother.

25:13.310 --> 25:13.960
Brother!

25:32.200 --> 25:33.590
We actually

25:33.590 --> 25:35.880
miraculously survived that day.

25:37.750 --> 25:39.550
God must have his intentions for

25:40.270 --> 25:41.870
making such an arrangement.

25:43.350 --> 25:45.160
Maybe it's so that you and I

25:44.680 --> 25:51.730
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

25:45.160 --> 25:46.640
can be like this,

25:47.000 --> 25:50.400
spending a few leisurely days
in this small fishing village.

25:51.750 --> 25:58.230
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

25:58.330 --> 26:05.970
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

26:06.090 --> 26:13.390
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

26:13.000 --> 26:13.920
The doctor said

26:13.530 --> 26:20.690
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

26:14.160 --> 26:16.690
your injury needs
another half month of rest.

26:16.720 --> 26:18.310
Just rest here.

26:19.510 --> 26:21.310
The bandit rebellion has been suppressed.

26:20.820 --> 26:30.560
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

26:21.310 --> 26:23.270
Hengtang is at peace now.

26:25.310 --> 26:27.270
It wouldn't be bad

26:27.510 --> 26:30.040
if we stayed here
for the rest of our lives too.

26:30.900 --> 26:38.100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

26:32.640 --> 26:34.480
We both have many things to do.

26:35.000 --> 26:36.530
We can't stay here forever.

26:38.120 --> 26:45.430
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

26:41.920 --> 26:43.650
Then let's make it half a month.

26:43.750 --> 26:44.880
For this half month,

26:45.200 --> 26:46.200
I am not Yan Rui,

26:45.450 --> 26:49.010
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

26:46.640 --> 26:48.040
and you are not Qingyuan.

26:48.440 --> 26:48.960
I am

26:48.960 --> 26:51.680
a fisherman, Yan,
from this tiny Anxiang Village.

26:49.030 --> 26:52.540
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

26:52.400 --> 26:55.310
And you are the pretty and articulate

26:52.570 --> 26:58.960
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

26:55.790 --> 26:57.920
village woman, Yunya, how about that?

27:03.680 --> 27:04.720
If

27:05.480 --> 27:07.340
I didn't have to avenge my mother,

27:08.110 --> 27:10.310
and you didn't have to plan for rations.

27:10.750 --> 27:11.590
I wonder

27:11.830 --> 27:13.830
what we would do staying here.

27:14.960 --> 27:21.090
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

27:15.000 --> 27:17.720
Yan would bask in the sun every day,

27:17.960 --> 27:19.030
and drink some wine.

27:19.030 --> 27:20.160
Having fish today

27:20.160 --> 27:21.160
but none tomorrow

27:21.210 --> 27:28.320
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

27:21.440 --> 27:22.240
is fine.

27:23.790 --> 27:24.790
What about Yunya?

27:25.110 --> 27:25.880
Yunya...

27:27.240 --> 27:29.200
In these days of eternal spring,

27:28.450 --> 27:35.850
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

27:29.590 --> 27:31.850
she can finally put down the heavy burden

27:32.590 --> 27:35.000
and live a life as she pleases.

27:36.040 --> 27:43.040
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

27:39.590 --> 27:40.240
Move?

27:40.680 --> 27:41.940
Where are we moving to?

27:42.480 --> 27:43.790
To a place

27:43.090 --> 27:50.190
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

27:44.590 --> 27:46.030
where it's always spring

27:47.270 --> 27:49.200
and flowers are blooming all year.

27:50.290 --> 28:00.860
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

27:51.350 --> 27:52.550
Shen Run.

27:53.070 --> 27:54.480
I met someone,

27:54.880 --> 27:56.340
who looks so much like you.

27:56.880 --> 27:59.440
His eyes are as bright as the stars.

27:59.920 --> 28:01.790
Sometimes, he's as gentle as you;

28:01.000 --> 28:07.940
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

28:02.310 --> 28:04.550
sometimes, he's as persistent as you.

28:06.510 --> 28:07.480
I'm tired.

28:08.030 --> 28:09.640
Let me lean on Yan's shoulder.

28:08.040 --> 28:15.700
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

28:12.110 --> 28:13.310
He seems to also have

28:13.310 --> 28:15.070
things he must accomplish.

28:15.740 --> 28:18.360
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

28:15.920 --> 28:17.550
So we always touch each other

28:18.240 --> 28:20.200
from near and far.

28:18.380 --> 28:22.000
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

28:20.720 --> 28:22.270
Neither of us dares to reach out

28:22.030 --> 28:28.370
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

28:22.880 --> 28:25.350
to uncover each other's true secrets.

28:32.060 --> 28:35.050
[Half a month later]

28:43.510 --> 28:45.710
What is she doing here putting on a show?

28:59.240 --> 29:01.310
Acting like a loving sister here?

29:01.680 --> 29:02.480
How fake,

29:02.480 --> 29:03.200
seriously.

29:08.400 --> 29:10.530
Qingyuan's whereabouts are unknown,

29:10.920 --> 29:13.720
yet you're in such a hurry
to hold a funeral for her.

29:13.830 --> 29:15.110
When one dies,

29:15.110 --> 29:17.030
it's only natural that a funeral is held.

29:17.030 --> 29:19.090
What nonsense are you talking about?

29:20.510 --> 29:21.970
I'm not talking nonsense.

29:22.400 --> 29:23.890
Need I remind you

29:23.910 --> 29:25.640
how you used to bully her?

29:28.830 --> 29:31.070
Qingyuan's memorial tablet is right here.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.070
Yet now,

29:32.550 --> 29:35.080
you dress in mourning clothes
on the surface,

29:35.350 --> 29:37.960
but you're still wearing perfume.

29:38.510 --> 29:41.110
You won't even give her
a last shred of respect.

29:41.550 --> 29:43.920
The gods are always watching.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.550
Maybe tonight,

29:47.070 --> 29:49.730
Qingyuan will come to settle the score
with you!

29:49.960 --> 29:51.020
What am I afraid of?

29:51.440 --> 29:53.590
Our grievances
haven't even been settled yet.

29:53.590 --> 29:54.270
Enough!

30:04.550 --> 30:05.480
Miss Dong.

30:06.350 --> 30:07.920
Since you're here to pay your respects,

30:07.920 --> 30:09.310
do it properly.

30:10.240 --> 30:11.640
In front of

30:12.350 --> 30:13.510
Qingyuan's spirit,

30:13.920 --> 30:15.980
please show some respect, everyone.

30:19.240 --> 30:20.500
You too, Second Madam.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.460
We'll discuss the shop

30:22.680 --> 30:23.590
in the future.

30:24.030 --> 30:24.690
Head Madam,

30:24.710 --> 30:26.790
the medicine shop really can't be delayed.

30:26.790 --> 30:27.720
The dead is gone,

30:27.720 --> 30:29.270
but life must go on.

30:29.510 --> 30:31.440
Every day we delay, we lose money.

30:31.590 --> 30:32.960
Why not hand it over to me?

30:32.960 --> 30:34.680
Can't I manage it for Qingyuan?

30:34.680 --> 30:35.510
Qingyuan put in

30:35.510 --> 30:37.350
so much effort for this shop.

30:38.270 --> 30:40.030
She's barely gone,

30:41.070 --> 30:43.440
and you're already fighting over money.

30:47.000 --> 30:49.000
Where is the Xie family's dignity?

30:50.200 --> 30:51.200
Miss Dong.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.750
Look at the funeral expenses.

30:54.750 --> 30:55.790
All these lanterns

30:55.790 --> 30:56.590
and cloth

30:56.590 --> 30:57.640
cost money.

30:58.070 --> 31:01.160
Money is the most urgent matter right now.

31:01.720 --> 31:02.750
Besides,

31:02.750 --> 31:04.830
this is our family matter—

31:04.830 --> 31:06.440
it's not your place to speak.

31:07.240 --> 31:09.830
-I feel sorry for Qingyuan.
-Go die in her stead, then.

31:09.830 --> 31:10.640
Enough.

31:11.510 --> 31:13.350
F-Fourth Lady?

31:28.440 --> 31:30.480
Who does Second Madam want dead?

31:34.310 --> 31:35.310
My child,

31:36.070 --> 31:37.070
you're alive.

31:37.750 --> 31:39.350
Is she a human or a ghost?

31:41.880 --> 31:42.920
Yes, Mother,

31:43.190 --> 31:44.150
I'm still alive.

31:44.680 --> 31:46.070
In broad daylight,

31:46.270 --> 31:48.590
could it be that I have become a ghost

31:48.830 --> 31:50.490
to settle scores with you all?

31:51.110 --> 31:52.200
You've done so much evil,

31:52.200 --> 31:54.260
and you dare to settle scores with us?

31:57.400 --> 31:58.790
This funeral

31:59.110 --> 32:00.680
is arranged so nicely.

32:01.790 --> 32:03.880
It's a pity it won't be used.

32:07.480 --> 32:10.160
It's rare for you all
to care so much about me.

32:11.640 --> 32:12.970
Thanks for the trouble.

32:14.030 --> 32:15.630
Thank heavens you're alive.

32:15.750 --> 32:16.830
As long as you're alive.

32:16.830 --> 32:18.000
I told you...

32:18.400 --> 32:19.110
-It's fine.
-Our Fourth Sister

32:19.110 --> 32:21.170
-is truly a lucky one.
-This is great!

32:21.880 --> 32:24.030
Falling off a cliff into the sea,

32:24.030 --> 32:25.960
you still can come back safely?

32:27.030 --> 32:28.750
That doesn't sound nice, Second Madam.

32:28.750 --> 32:30.350
I survived by a stroke of luck.

32:30.350 --> 32:31.070
Why

32:31.350 --> 32:33.440
does that make you unhappy?

32:34.770 --> 32:36.400
What are you talking about?

32:36.400 --> 32:37.640
We are family.

32:37.790 --> 32:39.200
Your safe return

32:39.400 --> 32:42.030
makes me the happiest.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.680
Really?

32:43.920 --> 32:45.310
But now that I'm back alive,

32:45.310 --> 32:46.880
your days

32:46.880 --> 32:48.480
won't be easy anymore.

32:49.400 --> 32:50.000
Is that so?

32:53.640 --> 32:54.510
Qingyuan.

32:55.310 --> 32:56.350
It's been so long.

32:56.790 --> 32:58.880
Why didn't you send a letter home?

32:59.350 --> 33:01.830
Do you know how worried we were about you?

33:02.590 --> 33:03.640
Grandmother,

33:04.160 --> 33:05.350
when I was away,

33:05.350 --> 33:06.480
I met an old friend,

33:06.750 --> 33:08.590
which delayed my return home.

33:08.830 --> 33:10.830
Apologies for making Grandmother, Father,

33:10.830 --> 33:12.630
and the rest of the family worry.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.830
It's okay, Qingyuan.

33:15.110 --> 33:17.070
As long as you are safe.

33:17.350 --> 33:18.950
Everything else is trivial.

33:19.310 --> 33:20.110
Don't mind it.

33:21.960 --> 33:22.640
Father.

33:23.030 --> 33:23.960
You promised me,

33:24.310 --> 33:25.510
if I went out to seek help,

33:25.510 --> 33:27.480
you would thoroughly investigate
Fifth Madam's death.

33:27.480 --> 33:29.240
I have brought the old friend back.

33:29.240 --> 33:30.240
I wonder if Father

33:30.550 --> 33:31.880
will keep your promise.

33:37.550 --> 33:38.590
Qingyuan,

33:39.920 --> 33:41.440
who is this old friend of yours

33:41.440 --> 33:42.400
you mention?

33:43.830 --> 33:45.030
Let me tell you that.

33:53.030 --> 33:54.290
Grandmother, Father,

33:54.880 --> 33:56.410
do you still recognize her?

34:05.070 --> 34:05.510
You...

34:06.310 --> 34:08.030
You are Fourth Madam's personal maid,

34:08.030 --> 34:08.960
Cui'er?

34:09.590 --> 34:11.880
She does look like her.

34:24.070 --> 34:25.330
Are you really Cui'er?

34:29.840 --> 34:30.550
Lord Yan,

34:30.880 --> 34:32.190
I apologize for the scene.

34:32.190 --> 34:33.389
It's a family matter.

34:33.630 --> 34:35.480
Let's move to the side hall.

34:35.510 --> 34:37.630
I'll have someone serve you tea,
how about that?

34:37.630 --> 34:38.400
No need.

34:39.110 --> 34:41.760
This concerns the reputation
of Fourth Lady's biological mother,

34:41.760 --> 34:43.280
I must intervene.

34:44.190 --> 34:46.550
Otherwise,
how can I face the one I fancy again?

34:46.550 --> 34:47.400
Don't you think,

34:47.400 --> 34:48.280
Lord Xie?

34:52.710 --> 34:54.110
I remember now.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.710
It was you back then

34:57.110 --> 34:58.440
who insisted

34:58.920 --> 35:00.400
that Fourth Lady

35:00.400 --> 35:02.760
poisoned Fifth Madam with euphorbia.

35:02.880 --> 35:04.670
And based on your testimony,

35:04.960 --> 35:06.760
I followed the Xie family rules

35:07.190 --> 35:08.400
and punished

35:09.150 --> 35:10.510
Jin Chunqing.

35:16.030 --> 35:17.490
Fourth Madam is innocent.

35:19.150 --> 35:20.960
It was my momentary lapse
of judgment back then,

35:20.960 --> 35:22.480
that made me help the wicked,

35:22.480 --> 35:25.480
making Fourth Madam
suffer an injustice for 19 years.

35:25.760 --> 35:27.800
You say Jin Chunqing
didn't kill my mother,

35:27.800 --> 35:29.440
then who killed my mother?

35:31.150 --> 35:32.280
It was Second Madam.

35:37.550 --> 35:38.440
Qingyuan,

35:38.440 --> 35:40.670
you can't just make baseless accusations.

35:40.670 --> 35:42.360
Saying I killed and framed someone—

35:42.360 --> 35:43.560
do you have evidence?

35:43.800 --> 35:45.060
Cui'er is the witness.

35:45.800 --> 35:48.190
You ordered Cui'er back then

35:48.510 --> 35:49.480
to put euphorbia

35:49.550 --> 35:51.680
into Fifth Madam's pregnancy potion.

35:52.400 --> 35:52.960
Cui'er!

35:55.280 --> 35:55.920
Tell me,

35:56.710 --> 35:58.320
how did Concubine Xia die?

36:02.070 --> 36:02.880
Speak!

36:20.800 --> 36:21.590
Speak!

36:23.840 --> 36:24.960
It was...

36:26.960 --> 36:30.020
It was Fourth Madam
who gave me a bowl of pregnancy tonic

36:33.360 --> 36:35.290
Fifth Madam passed away years ago.

36:35.480 --> 36:38.360
She should have reincarnated by now.

36:38.710 --> 36:39.030
You!

36:39.030 --> 36:40.510
With no proof,

36:40.710 --> 36:42.570
you can make up whatever you want.

36:43.110 --> 36:45.400
Besides, back then, didn't she personally

36:45.400 --> 36:47.130
testify against Fourth Madam,

36:47.360 --> 36:50.480
and then secretly disappear
for so many years?

36:50.670 --> 36:53.190
Now she pops up again talking nonsense.

36:53.760 --> 36:56.070
Is she treating this case as a joke?

36:56.880 --> 36:59.280
Back then, my brother owed gambling debts.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.510
Second Madam threatened us
with paying off the debts

37:01.510 --> 37:03.570
and forced me to betray Fourth Madam.

37:03.590 --> 37:05.920
I went against my conscience

37:06.110 --> 37:07.440
and made a huge mistake.

37:08.230 --> 37:08.920
After that,

37:09.480 --> 37:12.190
Second Madam forced my brother and me
to leave Hengtang.

37:12.190 --> 37:14.790
That's why we wandered
to another town to hide.

37:14.840 --> 37:15.400
Today,

37:15.630 --> 37:16.890
I have come to confess.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.800
I beg the patriarch of the Xie family

37:20.800 --> 37:21.590
and Old Madam

37:21.960 --> 37:23.480
to distinguish right from wrong,

37:23.480 --> 37:25.630
clear Fourth Madam's name,

37:26.230 --> 37:28.560
and bring the real murderer of Fifth Madam

37:29.110 --> 37:30.590
to justice!

37:32.800 --> 37:33.710
Absurd!

37:34.400 --> 37:36.030
A lowly maidservant like you

37:36.190 --> 37:39.190
think you can convict me
with a few nonsensical words?

37:39.190 --> 37:41.150
Might as well do what Lord Yan

37:41.150 --> 37:42.760
and Xie Qingyuan want.

37:43.280 --> 37:44.550
Go to court

37:44.920 --> 37:47.400
and let the whole Hengtang judge

37:47.400 --> 37:48.530
the right and wrong.

37:48.920 --> 37:49.590
Sure.

37:50.400 --> 37:51.730
I'll help you with that.

37:52.110 --> 37:52.840
Fan Zhong,

37:53.480 --> 37:55.340
take them back to the government.

37:55.360 --> 37:57.160
I will interrogate them myself.

37:57.400 --> 37:57.800
You—

37:58.400 --> 37:58.800
Yes.

37:59.070 --> 37:59.760
Wait.

38:01.280 --> 38:01.960
Lord Yan.

38:02.280 --> 38:02.960
I think...

38:03.440 --> 38:06.510
this is still my private matter.

38:06.760 --> 38:08.490
I think you should leave it to me

38:08.710 --> 38:10.230
for my own consideration.

38:11.190 --> 38:12.030
Why?

38:12.760 --> 38:14.890
Lord Xie, are you showing favoritism?

38:17.030 --> 38:17.840
Lord Yan.

38:18.030 --> 38:20.440
What are you talking about?

38:20.920 --> 38:22.580
This is my private residence.

38:23.510 --> 38:25.370
I have an elderly mother above me,

38:25.440 --> 38:28.030
and wives, concubines,
and children below me.

38:28.030 --> 38:30.400
These are all my closest relatives.

38:30.800 --> 38:34.800
Even if I'm being selfish and protective,

38:35.590 --> 38:37.110
shouldn't I be?

38:42.760 --> 38:44.000
However,

38:44.840 --> 38:48.150
Cui'er's appearance is suspicious.

38:48.590 --> 38:52.000
I am also very surprised by what she said.

38:52.230 --> 38:55.800
So I must personally
investigate it clearly.

38:57.320 --> 38:59.190
For what happened in the past,

38:59.360 --> 39:01.030
there would be no one else

39:01.400 --> 39:04.230
but me who's the most upset.

39:04.590 --> 39:06.800
If there really is a murderer,

39:07.110 --> 39:10.150
